@media (max-width: 768px) {
  .vimeo-responsive.portrait,
  .vimeo-responsive.square {
    max-width: 90%;
  }
}
&lt;/style&gt;

&lt;p&gt;An audiovisual presentation of research I did while writing an essay about Global Groove (1973) by Nam June Paik. At that moment in time, this was the most extensively researched and planned video project I had worked on. The writing and planning process prepared me for future projects. The audiovisual language of this video was inspired by Nam June Paik&amp;rsquo;s work – specifically his editing patterns and vibrant use of colours reflecting the contemporary trends in broadcast television and advertisements.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
      
